      section: "CS",
      q: "Consider solving the following system of simultaneous equations using LU decomposition.\nx1 + x2 − 2x3 = 4\nx1 + 3x2 − x3 = 7\n2x1 + x2 − 5x3 = 7\nwhere L and U are lower- and upper-triangular matrices with entries L11,L21,...,L33 and U11,U12,...,U33. Which one of the following is the correct combination of values for L32, U33, and x1?",
      options: ["L32 = 2, U33 = −1/2, x1 = −1","L32 = 2, U33 = 2, x1 = −1","L32 = −1/2, U33 = 2, x1 = 0","L32 = −1/2, U33 = −1/2, x1 = 0"],
      answer: 3,
