      q: "Consider the relational database with the following four schemas and their respective instances. Student(sNo, sName, dNo), Dept(dNo, dName), Course(cNo, cName, dNo), Register(sNo, cNo). SQL Query: SELECT * FROM Student AS S WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT cNo FROM Course WHERE dNo = 'D01' EXCEPT SELECT cNo FROM Register WHERE sNo = S.sNo) The number of rows returned by the above SQL query is___________.",
